# Quisirella — Output bao cao Markdown

Ghi file vao `output/`. Ngon ngu: **tieng Viet**.

## Frontmatter bat buoc (YAML)

```yaml
---
title: ...
generated_at: YYYY-MM-DD
data_range: YYYY-MM-DD den YYYY-MM-DD
sources: [meta_graph_api]
data_status: ok | partial | unavailable
ad_account_id: act_400356462876861
---
```

Them field tuy ngữ cảnh: `active_campaign_count`, `previous_ad_account_id`.

