## Format so lieu

- VND: dau cham ngan (8.546.101 VND)
- CTR: % mot chu so thap phan (3,57%)
- CPC/CPM: lam tron so nguyen VND
- Chi phi/tin nhan: lam tron so nguyen

## Cau truc section khuyen nghi

1. Tom tat executive (bang KPI chinh)
2. Bang so sanh / breakdown
3. Phan tich chi tiet (tung campaign hoac segment)
4. Funnel / xu huong (neu co)
5. Khuyen nghi hanh dong (scale/giu/giam/pause)
6. Phu luc nguon du lieu (duong dan raw JSON)

## Quy tac chat luong

- **Truoc khi ghi file 01-06:** chay quality gate trong `.cursor/skills/quisirella-context-engineering/references/report-rubric.md` — deterministic checks D1-D6 truoc, rubric sau. Fail 1 dimension = fix truoc khi ghi.
- **Khong bia so** khi API loi — ghi loi + `data_status: unavailable`
- Moi nhan dinh quan trong kem **so lieu cu the**
- So lieu chi copy tu bang verbatim cua meta-analyst hoac `data/meta_fetch/` — khong tinh lai, khong lam tron khac
- Link cheo giua file (vd. 01 → 06)
- Purchase Meta: luon ghi chu "khong phan anh doanh thu that (chot DM)"
